  "painted": {
    "describes": "Way P (paint.py; the shader's _OS_PAINT): the corner painted as a painter would, in a few broad designed value shapes from 107's facts, by the value plan in reviews/lt1/finish/p1. Each material is one value (albedo L*), shifted by three unequal planes (the wall's one gradient, the window dark, the sun's shadow) and by one failed-paint shape that follows the water, its wash and its peel two marks, each mark's character at its edge, which one authored stroke texture breaks near and which is lost with distance; near, long soft strokes along the boards let a plane breathe. Way P has its own overcast, a soft sky from the street that parts the gable from the street wall. Sizes in metres, values in L*.",
